@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam nodesep 45
skinparam ranksep 45
skinparam linetype polyline
skinparam padding 8
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam ArrowColor #52677A
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam classBackgroundColor #F5F8FB
skinparam classBorderColor #173B63
skinparam classHeaderBackgroundColor #DDEAF2
skinparam componentBackgroundColor #F5F8FB
skinparam componentBorderColor #173B63
skinparam packageBorderColor #8DA6B8
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF7DE
skinparam noteBorderColor #D4B66B
hide empty members
hide circle
title CIVITA 1.1.742 · Cuenta, preferencias y territorio
class UserProfile <<data class>> {
 + id: String {readOnly}
 + fullName: String {readOnly}
 + email: String {readOnly}
 + role: String {readOnly}
 + status: String {readOnly}
 + trustLevel: Long {readOnly}
}

class UserPreferences <<data class>> {
 + alertRadiusMeters: Long {readOnly}
 + categoryIds: List<String> {readOnly}
 + pushEnabled: Boolean {readOnly}
 + preciseLocationAllowed: Boolean {readOnly}
}

class UrbanEvent <<data class>> {
 + id: String {readOnly}
 + categoryId: String {readOnly}
 + title: String {readOnly}
 + description: String {readOnly}
 + startsAtMillis: Long {readOnly}
 + endsAtMillis: Long {readOnly}
 + status: String {readOnly}
}

class UserNotification <<data class>> {
 + id: String {readOnly}
 + type: String {readOnly}
 + title: String {readOnly}
 + body: String {readOnly}
 + sourceId: String {readOnly}
 + read: Boolean {readOnly}
}

class AlertSubscription <<data class>> {
 + id: String {readOnly}
 + categoryId: String {readOnly}
 + latitude: Double {readOnly}
 + longitude: Double {readOnly}
 + radiusMeters: Long {readOnly}
 + active: Boolean {readOnly}
}

class MapLayer <<data class>> {
 + id: String {readOnly}
 + name: String {readOnly}
 + layerType: String {readOnly}
 + active: Boolean {readOnly}
}

class LayerFeature <<data class>> {
 + id: String {readOnly}
 + name: String {readOnly}
 + latitude: Double {readOnly}
 + longitude: Double {readOnly}
}

class DeviceToken <<data class>> {
 + id: String {readOnly}
 + token: String {readOnly}
 + platform: String {readOnly}
}

UserProfile -[hidden]right- UserPreferences
UrbanEvent -[hidden]right- UserNotification
MapLayer -[hidden]right- LayerFeature
AlertSubscription -[hidden]right- DeviceToken
note bottom of DeviceToken
 Esquema y reglas preparados para tokens Android.
 Esta entrega no registra tokens ni envía push automático.
 El buzón de cambios de estado funciona mediante Firestore.
end note
legend bottom
 + público · - privado · {suspend} operación suspendida Kotlin
 Flecha continua: referencia de objetos. Discontinua: dependencia.
 Las relaciones por identificador se muestran en el MER, no como campos de objetos inexistentes.
 Data classes generan constructor, copy, componentN, equals, hashCode y toString.
endlegend
@enduml
